    "body": "Coordinator triage. The red run is 44950073227 on 6ffa808ae (#2714).\n\n- The one red step is `[1054] ui suites: trace_parity`. The test binary stopped after 1 s with `exit -1`. The log shows no test output, no panic and no assert.\n- The next step on the same runner (`waterjet_tool`) and all later steps passed.\n- This is the same signature as the transient failure of #3227: the process stopped before a test ran.\n- Classification: transient, not a code defect. No worker is assigned.\n- Check: the per-commit runs on c59aa0730 and a0fe9f1dc include #2714. If `trace_parity` passes there, this issue closes on the next green run. If one of them fails the step with an assert, the failure is real, and a worker takes it at once.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
