    "body": "Looks already fixed on upstream/main 2d98d87be: trace_parity passes without a change. Suggest closing; the maintainer decides.\n\nI ran cargo xtask gate batch --only \"ui suites: trace_parity\". All five tests passed.\nI then ran cargo test -p camcraft-ui --test trace_parity -- --test-threads=12 --nocapture from crates/ui.\nAll five tests passed again. They rendered through Vulkan on llvmpipe (LLVM 21.1.8, 256 bits). No test skipped.\n\nThe saved log from run 44950073227 shows three tests passed before the process stopped.\nThe unfinished tests were the_gpu_sees_the_box_the_cpu_sees and deviation_classes_agree_with_the_cpu_verdict.\nThe log has no assertion failure. This corrects the earlier statement that the process stopped before a test ran.\n\nI cannot identify a fixing commit. These results do not establish the cause of the earlier process failure.\nI made no code changes. Claim released.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
