    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T22:31:54Z",
    "body": "Both red runs are a runner environment problem, not code.\n\nRun 44948384882 (main `273642212`) ran on runner `skull`. Step `[1022] ui suites: lib` fails in 2 s with exit -1. The step log ends in the middle of the run, on a passing test line (257 of 1397 tests, last line `... ok`). No test failed and there is no panic: the test binary dies.\nRun 44950073227 (main `6ffa808ae`) ran on runner `egg`. Same signature: the ui `trace_parity` binary aborts in about 1 s with exit -1.\nGreen runs in the same period ran on `uma`, `wopr`, `wopr-2`, `dude` and `cheese`. Neither commit touches the UI test start-up path.\n\nClassification: infra. @mkinney no code fix is needed from you. The fix is on runners `egg` and `skull` - likely no GPU or display session on them. A later green run closes this issue.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
